<title>CANADA: Abitibi-Consolidated declares dividend.</title>
<headline>Abitibi-Consolidated declares dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>			  Latest		     Prior</p>
<p> Amount		 C$0.10			 N/A</p>
<p> Pay		    July 2</p>
<p> Record		 June 6</p>
<p>Note: Full name of company is Abitibi-Consolidated Inc. The amalgamation of Abitibi-Price Inc and Stone-Consoldited Corp to form Abitibi-Consolidated was effective on Friday. The dividend is the first for the merged company, which is based on Montreal.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
</text>
